# Local-only document archive.
# Superseded docs are moved here instead of being deleted, so the history of
# the product is still reachable locally without shipping stale positioning to
# collaborators. Nothing under this path is pushed.
# Note: docs/archive/ is a different, still-tracked directory — do not confuse
# the two.
docs/archive-local/
